    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Buzz In The Boardroom",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "luxury_lounge",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "2:15 PM · Conference Room A. Under the table, you furiously text the anonymous landlord who just raised your rent by 40%.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Listen here, \"Building Owner\": raising rent 40% overnight is highway robbery! Even my ice-cold CEO has more heart than you!!",
          "timestamp_label": "2:15 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "BZZZT! Across the mahogany table, CEO Theo Grant's personal phone lights up. He reads it, slowly raises his eyes to yours—and types.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "Glad to hear I have more heart than myself, {{player_name}}. Also, stop texting in my board meeting.",
          "timestamp_label": "2:16 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "YOU OWN MAPLEWOOD TOWERS?! Wait—why did you double my rent?!",
          "timestamp_label": "2:16 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "I didn't—my property manager did it by mistake, and I was about to comp your entire lease.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1900,
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "duration_sec": 6,
          "transcript": "[whispered in the hallway right after the meeting] My office. Five minutes. Bring your lease—and your attitude, {{player_name}}.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 850,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "You're walking into your billionaire boss's office. How do you handle this?",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_negotiate",
              "label": "Demand either lower rent OR a 40% raise",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Either you cancel the rent hike, or you give me a 40% raise, Mr. Grant.",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n09a"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_vip_banter",
              "label": "Remind him you saw his unsent message",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "VIP · Cheeky",
              "player_reply_text": "Did you really just say \"comp my entire lease\" before hitting unsend? 👀",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n09b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09a",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "Bold negotiation, {{player_name}}. What if I give you BOTH—plus a key to the penthouse gym?",
          "timestamp_label": "2:22 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09b",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "Fast eyes, {{player_name}}. Come inside and close the door—you're getting a very different lease.",
          "timestamp_label": "2:22 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "New Lease Terms.",
          "teaser_text": "Episode 2: Theo slides a zero-dollar lease across his desk—and admits he lives right above your apartment.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "The Neighbor Upstairs",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "rain",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "9:30 PM · Back at your apartment. A thunderstorm knocks out your kitchen breaker—and your phone chimes.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "Your balcony lights just went out, {{player_name}}. Did your breaker trip?",
          "timestamp_label": "9:30 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait... how do you know my balcony lights went out?! Are you spying on me, Landlord?!",
          "timestamp_label": "9:31 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "I live in Penthouse 18A directly above you. And I'm currently standing outside your door with a flashlight and Thai takeout.",
          "timestamp_label": "9:31 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "I bought this entire building six months ago after seeing you walk your dog out front.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1900,
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[soft knock on your door] Open up, {{player_name}}. The pad thai is getting cold, and maintenance won't be here till morning.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 850,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Your cold CEO is outside your door with takeout in a thunderstorm.",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_let_in",
              "label": "Let him in—and ask about the 6-month secret",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Come in. And you're explaining that \"bought the building\" line over dinner.",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08a"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_vip_penthouse",
              "label": "Ask if Penthouse 18A has power—and a view",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "VIP · Sweet",
              "player_reply_text": "My place is dark—how about we eat upstairs at your penthouse instead? 😉",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08a",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "Fair warning, {{player_name}}—once I start confessing, I'm not stopping at the building.",
          "timestamp_label": "9:34 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08b",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "theo",
          "text": "18A has backup generators, a skyline view, and zero rent hikes. After you, {{player_name}}.",
          "timestamp_label": "9:34 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Rent Free In His Heart.",
          "teaser_text": "Season Finale · As thunder rolls outside, Theo smiles—no longer the ice-cold CEO, just the man who waited six months to knock.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
